<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Microsystems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Microsystems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it cut its rating on Trident Microsystems Inc to buy from strong buy, but did not change earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, the investment firm said shares of Trident, a developer of graphical accelerators, controllers and processors, are fairly valued at their current price and should trade in-line with others in the graphics chip group.</p>
<p>-- In adddition, Hambrecht said the graphics industry as a whole is experienceing weak pricing, making it difficult for Trident to beat March earnings expectations.  Hambrecht forecasts a profit of $0.38 a share in the March quarter.</p>
</text>
